# Description of maps in F\_i^+
%%%
tag := "Chapter6/Definition6.6.3_maps"
number := false
%%%

Also, all maps stay the same except those now pointing out of $`i`; these are replaced by compositions of the inclusion of $`\ker \varphi` into $`\bigoplus_{j \to i} V_j` with the projections $`\bigoplus_{j \to i} V_j \to V_i`.
